<section class="r-vig2" id="vigil" aria-labelledby="vig-title">
<div class="w"><div>
 <h2 id="vig-title">AI you can defend <span>to your regulator.</span></h2>
 <p class="lead">Vigil, the AI investigator inside Relyxus, finds the cause, shows every piece of evidence it used and drafts the fix. Nothing runs until your people approve.</p>
 <div class="pr">
  <div><i>1</i><p><b>Every claim cites its source</b><span>A release, a metric, a log line. Click any answer and see exactly what it is based on.</span></p></div>
  <div><i>2</i><p><b>Account numbers never reach the model</b><span>Card, sort code, account and NI numbers are redacted first. The model runs inside your cloud.</span></p></div>
  <div><i>3</i><p><b>It cannot run a fix on its own</b><span>Vigil drafts the change. Two named people approve it with a passkey.</span></p></div>
 </div>
 <div class="bts"><a class="b1" href="/vigil">Meet Vigil</a><a class="b2" href="/demo">Ask it in the live demo</a></div>
</div>
<div class="vw"><div class="hd"><b><i>V</i>Vigil, INC 2047</b><span>Inside your cloud</span></div>
 <div class="bd">
  <div class="q">Card payments are failing across the UK. What changed in the last hour, and what do we owe the FCA?</div>
  <div class="a"><i>V</i><div>
   <p class="tx">Errors began <b>two minutes after release 4.18.2</b> of card authorisation went out. I am <b>92% confident</b> it is the cause.</p>
   <div class="bl"><div class="bh"><span>Likely causes</span><span>3 sources</span></div>
    <div class="hy"><b>1</b><div><b>Release 4.18.2, card authorisation</b><small>Deployed 03:10, failed a timeout test in staging</small></div><u><s style="width:92%"></s></u><strong>92%</strong></div>
    <div class="hy"><em>2</em><div>Database connection pool<small>Saturation rose after errors began</small></div><u><s style="width:6%"></s></u><strong>6%</strong></div>
    <div class="hy"><em>3</em><div>Card network upstream<small>Its status page is green</small></div><u><s style="width:2%"></s></u><strong>2%</strong></div></div>
   <div class="bl"><div class="bh"><span>Evidence</span><span>Sample data</span></div>
    <div class="tl"><em>03:10</em><span>Release 4.18.2 deployed to card authorisation</span><sup>Change</sup></div>
    <div class="tl"><em>03:12</em><span>Error rate rose from 0.2% to 38%</span><sup>Metric</sup></div>
    <div class="lg">03:12:04 ERROR card_auth auth_timeout after 3000ms<br>03:12:04 ERROR card_auth auth_timeout after 3000ms</div></div>
   <p class="tx" style="margin-top:12px">The FCA initial notification is drafted from this timeline. It waits for your signature.</p>
   <div class="pp"><div><b>Roll back card authorisation to 4.18.1</b><small>Needs two approvers with a passkey. I cannot run it myself.</small></div><span>Send for approval</span></div>
   <div class="sg"><button type="button" data-ask="Show me how Relyxus drafts an FCA report">Show the FCA draft</button><button type="button" data-ask="How does Relyxus draft customer notices?">Draft the customer notice</button><button type="button" data-ask="How does Relyxus show who else is affected?">Who else is affected?</button></div>
  </div></div>
 </div></div>
</div></section>
